<b>
<a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=92&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">And now a word from The Minister of Information</a></b><hr>
<img src="http://www.tenacityguild.com/images/news/dipstick.jpg"><br />
<br />
&quot;There are no Tenacity infidels in Kael. Never! I triple guarantee you, there are no Tenacity in Kael.   They're not even near the arena. They are not in any place. They hold no place in Kael. This is an illusion ... they are trying to sell to the others an illusion.&quot;<br />
<br />
&quot;Our initial assessment is that they will all die&quot;<br />
<br />
&quot;Rallos Zek will roast their stomachs in hell at the hands of The Avatar of War.&quot;<br />
<br />
&quot;They do not even have control over themselves! Do not believe them!&quot;<br />
<br />
&quot;I would like to clarify a simple fact here: How they kill The Avatar of War? Who is really being killed now? The Statue of Rallos Zek cannot be killed by them. The Idol of Rallos Zek cannot be killed by them. They cannot kill The Avatar of War.&quot;<br />
<br />
&quot;That bastard Tiberinus, and I won't say shamelessly, because Tenacity don't know what shame means. These are criminals. This criminal sitting in Kael is a pathetic criminal and his guild deserves to be beaten. These criminals lie to the world because they are criminals by nature and conditioning. They consider this a raid! Shame on you! You will forever be shamed! You have ruined the reputation of Tenacity in the most terrible way! Shame on you! And we will destroy you!&quot;<br />
<br />
Well, Contrary to the bullshit spewed by an unnamed DIPSHIT gratsing us on our wipe ahead of time:<br />
<br />
<img src=http://www.tenacityguild.com/images/news/aowdying.jpg><br />
<br />
DEAD - Burns doesnt it motherfucker?<br />
<br />
Just like last time this was one hell of a fun fight.   The difference between 1% and dead is nothing.   Nothing to gloat over, nothing to make fun.<br />
<br />
Avatar of War may be &quot;EASIER&quot; with Planes of Power, and Luclin then when other guilds did in the past.   Im sure for a Plane of Time guild it IS easy, but we are far from that.   This was the funest, most challenging, and most rewarding fight we have done since our first Vindicator kill.   The best part for me was:  The same person who said we cant do Vindi was FD watching us kill The Avatar of War that we couldnt do as well.<br />
<br />
Welcome to Farm Status AoW.</td>
